  "_comment": "The Prism-system intro cinematic. glide: far out & below the plane -> risen above it, eased in to near Home's (3rd) orbit. coast: an endless gentle slow orbit (a full turn every ~4 min). Poses are orbit poses about the sun at the origin: yaw/pitch in radians, distance in the viewer's AU-like units. Edit + rerun (no recompile) to retune the fly-in.",
